---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "./_support/support.scss";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support"
  pageTitle="Crona support"
  description="Need help with Crona? Bugs, questions, and contribution paths."
>
  <section class="container section">
    <div class="page-header flow measure">
      <h1>Need help with Crona?</h1>
      <p>Bugs, questions, and contribution paths.</p>
      <p class="support-lede">Crona is maintained in the open. The fastest way to get help is usually through GitHub.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="support-grid page-body">
      <article class="support-card support-card--primary">
        <span>Releases</span>
        <strong>Check the latest Crona builds and release notes.</strong>
        <p>Find current core and macOS releases, then follow the project updates on GitHub.</p>
        <ul class="support-card__links">
          <li><a href="/releases/">Releases</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/webxsid/crona/releases" rel="noreferrer">GitHub releases</a></li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="support-card support-card--primary">
        <span>Report a Bug</span>
        <strong>Found broken behavior or an incorrect result?</strong>
        <p>Found a bug or broken workflow? Open an issue with your OS, Crona version, install method, and reproduction steps.</p>
        <ul class="support-card__links">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/webxsid/crona/issues" rel="noreferrer">GitHub Issues</a></li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="support-card support-card--primary">
        <span>Ask a Question</span>
        <strong>Need help understanding a workflow or feature?</strong>
        <p>Ask how something works, discuss workflows, or check whether a feature already exists.</p>
        <ul class="support-card__links">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/webxsid/crona/discussions" rel="noreferrer">GitHub Discussions</a></li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="support-card support-card--primary">
        <span>Contribute</span>
        <strong>Browse the code, file improvements, or help shape the workflow.</strong>
        <p>Crona is open source. Browse the code, file improvements, or help shape the workflow.</p>
        <ul class="support-card__links">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/webxsid/crona" rel="noreferrer">GitHub repository</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://docs.crona.work/contributing/" rel="noreferrer">Contribution guide</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://docs.crona.work/development/" rel="noreferrer">Development docs</a></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="support-section page-body">
      <div class="page-header flow support-section__header">
        <h2>Common places to start</h2>
      </div>

      <ul class="support-topics">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/webxsid/crona/issues" rel="noreferrer">Report a bug</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/webxsid/crona/discussions" rel="noreferrer">Ask a question</a></li>
        <li><a href="/releases/">Read release notes</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="support-section page-body">
      <div class="page-header flow support-section__header">
        <h2>Support expectations</h2>
      </div>

      <p class="support-copy">
        Crona is an open-source project maintained in public. Community support happens through GitHub Issues and Discussions. Response times may vary.
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
